---
title: Sequence 2 - GET /api/patients/{id} (View Patient)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Authenticated Client
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant MW as Auth Middleware
    participant Policy as PatientPolicy
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: GET /api/patients/{id} Authorization Bearer token
    API->>MW: Verify Sanctum token
    MW-->>API: Authenticated
    API->>API: Resolve Patient via route model binding
    API->>Policy: authorize('view', patient)
    alt admin or doktor
        Policy-->>API: Allowed
    else pacijent requesting own record
        Policy-->>API: Allowed
    else pacijent requesting another patient
        Policy-->>API: Denied
        API-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end
    API->>DB: SELECT patient with socioeconomic eager load
    DB-->>API: Patient + PatientSocioeconomic
    API-->>Client: 200 PatientResource JSON
